UNIT valid_username
KIND FUNCTIONAL
ORACLE-CLASS deterministic
FIDELITY spec
ANCHOR this server's own rule for usernames, chosen 2026-11 so a username fits a Mii name field and a URL without escaping
SIG valid_username(username: text) -> none
ENVELOPE username is any well-formed text.
DEPENDS-ON none
DESCRIPTION Whether a username can be used on this server.
BEHAVIOR
R1 A username is accepted, answering none, when it is 6 to 16 characters long and every character is an ASCII letter, a digit, ".", "-" or "_".
R2 Anything else throws with exactly: username must be 6 to 16 characters, using only letters, numbers, dots, dashes and underscores
R3 Case does not matter to whether it is accepted. Spaces, other punctuation and any character outside ASCII are refused, wherever they are.
PROVENANCE recorded by rdv from accounts/accounts.go
ORACLE value -> oracles/valid_username.json CANONICAL-SHA256 b05a300ad4f186d44b3dea2cca3092a4eda81828624e19bfd829b04aac44592f
NOTE rules written; no independent rebuild has been graded yet.
